    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 3,
      "raw": "The runnable contracts and examples are maintained in [`examples/`](../examples/). Build them in the repository `build/` directory. Use the installed native SDK kit documented in `docs/`; the Congregation integration uses C++23 and contains no Qt runtime.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 4,
      "end_line": 4,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 9,
      "raw": "`NativeNavigationGallery` demonstrates route/history models.\n`NativePageRouterGallery` constructs two independent AOT LVUI pages in one\niiGUI surface. New application sources live in each example's `App/` directory.\nInstallers build and package without launching applications or tests; runtime\nvalidation remains deferred to the final whole-goal batch.\n"
    }
  ],
